{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"13":{"eng-name":"The Chapters on Rulings","ara-name":"كتاب الأحكام"}},"section_detail":{"13":{"hadithnumber_first":2308,"hadithnumber_last":2374,"arabicnumber_first":2308,"arabicnumber_last":2374}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2345,"arabicnumber":2345,"text":"Rapporté par 'Imran bin Husain : Un homme avait six esclaves et il n’avait pas d’autre bien qu’eux, et il les affranchit à sa mort. Le Messager d’Allah (ﷺ) les répartit en groupes, en affranchit deux et laissa les quatre autres comme esclaves","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Muslim"}],"reference":{"book":13,"hadith":38},"chapter":{"id":20,"ara-name":"باب الْقَضَاءِ بِالْقُرْعَةِ","eng-name":"Passing Judgment By Casting Lots","isFirstHadith":true}}]}